  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "StandX is a multi-chain Perps DEX on BNB/BSC and Solana powered by yield-bearing DUSD, with a DefiLlama-tracked canonical bridge component. Solana/SVM audit coverage should be tracked separately from BSC/EVM contract coverage unless an audit explicitly covers the same EVM code or a verified equivalence mapping exists.",
